{"mode":"words","text":"Ovenfor ser du en tekst præcis, som appen viser den. Hvert ord er et lille kort: øverst står ordet på dit målsprog, og nedenunder står dets betydning på dit modersmål — ord for ord, i målsprogets rækkefølge. Derunder står hele sætningen endnu en gang oversat i en sammenhængende tekst. For sprog med et andet skriftsystem tilføjes en linje med transskriptionen, så du kan læse det hele. Tryk på et ord: Stemmen fortsætter afspilningen præcis derfra.","words":[{"s":0,"e":453},{"s":522,"e":731},{"s":766,"e":813},{"s":859,"e":917},{"s":987,"e":1300},{"s":1335,"e":1811},{"s":1834,"e":2009},{"s":2090,"e":2357},{"s":2392,"e":2740},{"s":2763,"e":3042},{"s":3425,"e":3727},{"s":3808,"e":3982},{"s":4029,"e":4110},{"s":4133,"e":4191},{"s":4249,"e":4470},{"s":4528,"e":5027},{"s":5840,"e":6153},{"s":6188,"e":6478},{"s":6571,"e":6815},{"s":6850,"e":6954},{"s":7001,"e":7129},{"s":7187,"e":7941},{"s":8266,"e":8371},{"s":8417,"e":8940},{"s":8975,"e":9230},{"s":9276,"e":9427},{"s":9508,"e":10054},{"s":10135,"e":10251},{"s":10298,"e":10425},{"s":10472,"e":11134},{"s":11308,"e":11459},{"s":11784,"e":11993},{"s":12051,"e":12179},{"s":12248,"e":12713},{"s":13038,"e":13131},{"s":13212,"e":13955},{"s":14036,"e":14872},{"s":16172,"e":16625},{"s":16672,"e":16904},{"s":16973,"e":17241},{"s":17310,"e":17798},{"s":17891,"e":18146},{"s":18169,"e":18227},{"s":18285,"e":18483},{"s":18576,"e":19063},{"s":19156,"e":19226},{"s":19249,"e":19319},{"s":19388,"e":20050},{"s":20108,"e":20689},{"s":21803,"e":21943},{"s":21977,"e":22372},{"s":22430,"e":22639},{"s":22697,"e":22767},{"s":22837,"e":23069},{"s":23092,"e":23847},{"s":23928,"e":24532},{"s":24613,"e":24706},{"s":24799,"e":25193},{"s":25263,"e":25437},{"s":25460,"e":26494},{"s":26552,"e":26679},{"s":26726,"e":26796},{"s":26842,"e":26946},{"s":26981,"e":27306},{"s":27364,"e":27446},{"s":27481,"e":28084},{"s":29384,"e":29651},{"s":29709,"e":29790},{"s":29825,"e":29883},{"s":29953,"e":30406},{"s":31010,"e":31451},{"s":31520,"e":319